{"id":"e0b222616a3f7d44","task_id":"task_769736d7","background_task_id":"bg_405b7f22","status":"completed","review_outcome":"completed_with_findings","review_scope":{"files_reviewed":6,"added_lines":391,"tests_ran":false,"checks":[{"name":"conflict_marker_check","status":"passed","message":"新增行冲突标记=0"},{"name":"static_check","status":"passed","message":"新增行 TODO/panic 字符串提示=0；仅供人工判断"},{"name":"secret_scan","status":"passed","message":"原始 diff 新增行疑似密钥命中=0；未记录密钥值"},{"name":"finding_verification","status":"passed","message":"候选=2；证据匹配=2；第二轮复核确认=2；第二轮复核排除=0；有根据待核实=0；证据待定=0"}]},"source":"https://api.github.com/repos/gin-gonic/gin/pulls/2632","comments":[{"file":"context.go","line":770,"severity":"high","confidence":"high","body":"RemoteIP 在每次请求中都调用 prepareTrustedCIDRs 并把结果写回引擎共享字段 c.engine.trustedCIDRs。Engine 被所有并发请求共享，且 Run 启动时也写入该字段，因此多个 goroutine 会对同一 slice header 并发写（写后再读），构成数据竞争；同时每个请求重复解析 CIDR 也带来无谓开销。","evidence":"trustedCIDRs, _ := c.engine.prepareTrustedCIDRs()\n\tc.engine.trustedCIDRs = trustedCIDRs\n\tif c.engine.trustedCIDRs != nil {","trigger":"用 gin.Default()/New() 启动服务后，任意并发请求调用 c.ClientIP() 或 c.RemoteIP()（默认 Logger 中间件或业务代码即可触发），在 go test -race / -race 运行时会报 DATA RACE。","impact":"并发读写 slice header 可能读到撕裂值（指针与长度不匹配），导致 for 循环越界 panic 或使用到错误的 CIDR 列表，使服务在并发下不稳定。","suggestion":"移除 RemoteIP 内的写回，改为在 Run（或 sync.Once/New 之后）一次性计算并缓存 engine.trustedCIDRs，请求路径只读；再用 go test -race 并发调用 ClientIP 验证无竞争。","verification_status":"second_pass_review_passed","verification_reason":"新增的 RemoteIP 在每次请求中执行 c.engine.trustedCIDRs = trustedCIDRs（context.go:771），而 c.engine 指向被所有请求 goroutine 共享的同一个 *Engine（context.go:56，Engine 作为 http.Handler 处理所有并发请求），Engine.trustedCIDRs 是普通 slice header 字段（gin.go:135），没有任何同步。同时 Run 也会写该字段（gin.go:333），且同一函数紧随其后读取它（context.go:772-773）。因此并发请求（默认 Logger/业务调用 ClientIP→RemoteIP）会对同一 slice header 非同步读写，构成 Go 内存模型下的数据竞争，-race 会报 DATA RACE，理论上可能读到指针与长度不匹配的撕裂值。触发路径明确、无需额外未核实前提。","trace_id":"5fbe9e2976095ec4"},{"file":"gin.go","line":162,"severity":"medium","confidence":"high","body":"默认 TrustedProxies 只有 \"0.0.0.0/0\"，它是 IPv4 网络（4 字节掩码）。当 RemoteAddr 为 IPv6 时，IPNet.Contains 会因 IP 长度与网段长度不符返回 false，trusted=false，ClientIP 直接返回 IPv6 远端地址而忽略 X-Forwarded-For。旧实现不区分地址族，总是优先使用 X-Forwarded-For，故默认行为对 IPv6 场景发生改变。","evidence":"TrustedProxies:         []string{\"0.0.0.0/0\"},","trigger":"使用默认配置（未修改 TrustedProxies），服务监听 IPv6 或经 IPv6 代理转发，且请求头携带 X-Forwarded-For/X-Real-IP。","impact":"ClientIP 退化为代理的 IPv6 地址而非真实客户端 IP，与旧行为不一致；基于 ClientIP 的限流、审计日志、ACL 会失效或误判。","suggestion":"默认值补上 IPv6 网段，如 []string{\"0.0.0.0/0\", \"::/0\"}，并新增 RemoteAddr 为 IPv6 的用例断言 X-Forwarded-For 被采用；核实部署是否确会使用 IPv6。","verification_status":"second_pass_review_passed","verification_reason":"代码路径已完整查证：默认 TrustedProxies=[]string{\"0.0.0.0/0\"} 经 prepareTrustedCIDRs 解析为 IPv4 网络（net.ParseCIDR 得到 4 字节掩码）。Context.RemoteIP 使用 net.ParseIP 解析 RemoteAddr 后用 cidr.Contains(remoteIP) 判断；对真实 IPv6 地址（如 2001:db8::1），net.IPNet.Contains 中 ip.To4() 返回 nil，IP 长度 16 与网段长度 4 不符即返回 false，故 trusted=false。ClientIP 在 trusted=false 时直接返回 remoteIP.String()，完全跳过 RemoteIPHeaders（X-Forwarded-For/X-Real-IP）。因此在默认配置且远端为 IPv6 代理的请求中，X-Forwarded-For 被忽略、返回代理 IPv6 地址，导致限流/审计/ACL 依据错误地址。核心缺陷不依赖未展示的旧实现，仅由当前固定源码即可推导。","trace_id":"001c5acce3e8ce42"}],"todos":[{"content":"扫描并解析代码变更","status":"completed","order":0},{"content":"执行单 Agent 代码审查","status":"completed","order":1},{"content":"核对代码证据、第二轮复核并去重审查发现","status":"completed","order":2}],"trace":[{"id":"79a7332d523190cb","kind":"input","status":"succeeded","tool":"task_create","input":"","output":"","at":"2026-09-26T20:41:38.697+08:00","started_at":"2026-09-26T20:41:38.689+08:00","ended_at":"2026-09-26T20:41:38.697+08:00","duration_ms":7,"phase":"task"},{"id":"4323fe3c685d269e","kind":"input","status":"succeeded","tool":"task_claim","input":"","output":"","at":"2026-09-26T20:41:38.709+08:00","started_at":"2026-09-26T20:41:38.697+08:00","ended_at":"2026-09-26T20:41:38.709+08:00","duration_ms":11,"phase":"task"},{"id":"698b4a2be9049448","kind":"input","sta